---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact | BeaconGuard Controlled Evaluation"
  description="Contact BeaconGuard to evaluate a consequential AI workflow requiring exact-action authorization, verified policy authority, fail-closed execution control, and verifiable evidence."
>
  <section class="stack-section">
    <h1>Evaluate a consequential AI workflow</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Contact BeaconGuard when an AI or agent can move beyond recommendations into actions that communicate externally, update a regulated record, change a production system, affect a patient or customer, or initiate another consequential side effect.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section">
    <h2>Useful context to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Organization and industry</li>
      <li>Your role</li>
      <li>The bounded workflow under consideration</li>
      <li>What exact actions the AI or agent may attempt</li>
      <li>Which identity, delegation, MCP/A2A, API, or application paths are involved</li>
      <li>Which system ultimately executes the side effect</li>
      <li>Which approvals or policy authorities should govern it</li>
      <li>Primary review goal: architecture, security, evidence, or deployment fit</li>
      <li>Approximate timeline</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section">
    <h2>Do not submit</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>PHI</li>
      <li>Customer records</li>
      <li>Credentials</li>
      <li>Production secrets</li>
      <li>Confidential evidence packages</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section">
    <h2>Common starting points</h2>
    <div class="section-grid section-grid--compact">
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Healthcare</h3>
        <p>AI-assisted patient communication, scheduling, operational updates, or bounded discharge operations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Financial services</h3>
        <p>AML/KYC, fraud, dispute, customer communication, case-state, or other customer-impacting actions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="content-card">
        <h3>Internal automation</h3>
        <p>Agents or automations capable of consequential changes to production systems.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section">
    <h2>Review material</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/platform">Product</a></li>
      <li><a href="/how-it-works">How It Works</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/architecture">System Architecture</a></li>
      <li><a href="/proof-evidence">Proof and Evidence</a></li>
      <li><a href="/reviewer-kit">Reviewer Kit</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="stack-section">
    <h2>Direct channel</h2>
    <p>
      <a class="btn-primary" href="mailto:architecture@beaconguardassurance.com?subject=BeaconGuard%20Controlled%20Evaluation">architecture@beaconguardassurance.com</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
